# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Real emails are personal data: never commit them. Only fixtures/README.md and
# fixtures/redacted/ (reviewed, redacted samples) are tracked.
fixtures/*
!fixtures/README.md
!fixtures/redacted/
*.eml
# Synthetic emails signed with throwaway keys (no personal data) may be committed.
!fixtures/redacted/*.eml
*.mbox
*.msg

